# November 19, 2026: Cohoes again, with Waterford's Barge Canal flight and two places north in Halfmoon, Clifton Park
# and Mechanicville. Drawn at random by tools/choose.py --state ny (region conf). Earlier batches (conf_simf, conf_biei)
# took the old Champlain Canal, downtown Cohoes' bank, city hall, music hall and mills, and Watervliet. This batch
# writes full entries for three of the first catalogue's one-line pins (Harmony Mills, the Van Schaick Mansion, the
# Waterford Flight), adds the rest of the Spindle City Historic Society's downtown tour that stands out (the 1854 grist
# mill, the 1848 firehouse, the 1852 Mohawk River Mill, three churches), two walkable stretches of the enlarged Erie
# Canal in Cohoes, the Ellsworth monument and the empty Clifton Park Hotel.
# Sources opened in this session: Wikipedia as raw text (tools/wiki_raw.py); the Spindle City Historic Society's three
# 2023 tour brochures, the Harmony Mills National Historic Landmark nomination (78003151), the DAR's Van Schaick Mansion
# page, Passageport, the Waterford Historical Museum, Tug 44, NYS Canals, the Waterford Canal Festival directions page,
# Magic 100.5 and the Saratoga County History Center through tools/page.py.
